title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf gui
catalog: CLI command
target: mf gui
summary: Drive the GUI through its scripting HTTP API

!! Reference

```
Drive the GUI through its scripting HTTP API

Usage: mf gui [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  status     Print the GUI state (pretty-printed JSON)
  repo       Print the active repository of the focused workspace
  query      Print the query the metarecord list shows (finder included); an empty line = every metarecord; exit 1 when the list has not run
  selected   Print the checked metarecords' UUIDs, one per line (nothing checked = no output)
  workspace  Workspace (tab) management
  layout     Print or assign the slot layout ('-' = hidden slot)
  view       Print or set the panel type shown in a slot
  message    Post a message to a workspace's status bar
  progress   Report progress for the running script (updates its task-bar entry)
  bench      Print the recorded bench measures (JSON), or clear the buffer
  command    Run a command invocation through the GUI (same as the command input)
  input      Wait for one of the given keys and print it
  prompt     Prompt the user in the command input and print the answer
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --gui-url <GUI_URL>
          GUI base URL (default: gui-port from the GUI config.toml)
          
          [env: METAFOLDER_GUI_URL=]

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
